 * Thanks to instafel (https://github.com/mamiiblt/instafel) for identifying that
 * Compose surfaces read their AMOLED prism-black tone from the GRAY_1600 constant
 * inside BasePrismColorsV2's static initializer (<clinit>), rather than from a
 * color resource - so the colors.xml overrides in the AMOLED theme patch never
 * touch it.
 *
 * Their own patcher can just open BasePrismColorsV2.smali as a text file and
 * rewrite the line in place; confirmed by diffing decompiled output that this
